mmate immediately, allowing them to lead with whatever combination gives them the best chance to empty their hand. If I play ♠J or ♠K, the landlord gets a turn, which could disrupt my teammate\'s winning opportunity. Team victory is the goal, and passing maximizes our chances.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
